From: Zurker <47176362+XIAO1287643931@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 09:32:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Papo: drive the login finish from the main-thread queue as
 verification completes

The VERIFYING -> LoginSuccess transition only happens in tick(), so the
login waits for the next tick boundary after the authenticator thread
finishes - up to 50ms of pure quantization per join. The completion now
hops to the main-thread task queue with the identical guards to the
regular tick() path (disconnecting / awaiting cookies / VERIFYING);
single execution is guaranteed by main-thread serialization plus the
state transition happening inside the guarded block.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
index 4d04bac8f898fe239849434f6ad1a4d15a2f7fc9..86092077d69e32c3b526b79a89b94f4f2d047a9f 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.java
@@ -213,6 +213,23 @@ public class ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl implements ServerLoginPacketListener,
         // write chains for their files and are consumed at the original load points.
         this.server.getPlayerList().papoPrefetchJoinData(new net.minecraft.server.players.NameAndId(authenticatedProfile));
         // Papo end - batch 82: join read-side prefetch
+        // Papo start - batch 88: drive the login finish from the main-thread task queue instead
+        // of waiting for the next tickChildren (up to 50ms of pure quantization per join).
+        // Same window packet handlers run in; identical guards to the regular tick() path
+        // (disconnect/cookie/VERIFYING) and single execution is guaranteed because both
+        // paths run serialized on the main thread and the state transition happens inside.
+        try {
+            this.server.execute(() -> {
+                if (!this.disconnecting
+                    && this.state == ServerLoginPacketListenerImpl.State.VERIFYING
+                    && !this.paperLoginConnection.isAwaitingCookies()) {
+                    this.verifyLoginAndFinishConnectionSetup(Objects.requireNonNull(this.authenticatedProfile));
+                }
+            });
+        } catch (final Throwable ignored) {
+            // executor rejected (shutdown tail): the regular tick path still completes the login
+        }
+        // Papo end - batch 88: event-driven login finish
     }
 
     private void verifyLoginAndFinishConnectionSetup(GameProfile profile) {
